# Test-only patch for the SteamVR layer (src/vklayer-steamvr; never commit it applied). What vrcompositor does with
# its memory and its commands, to find where it takes the stream frame's pose (docs/streaming.md item 13, 2026-11-14):
# - /tmp/q1-trace: per process, /tmp/q1trace.<name>.<pid>.txt: descriptor writes (W), buffer bindings (M), sets
#   bound (S), vkCmdUpdateBuffer (U, size only) and vkCmdCopyBuffer (C, with the source's floats when the layer knows
#   its mapping: vkMapMemory, vkMapMemory2, host-pointer imports). ~0.25 MB/s for vrcompositor: keep it short.
# - /tmp/q1-maplist: the mapped allocations to /tmp/q1maps.txt.
# - /tmp/q1-lockin "HZ MAXBYTES": every float of the mapped allocations up to MAXBYTES, sampled at each submit, its
#   component at HZ (the shim's /tmp/q1-posesine) to /tmp/q1lockin.txt when the file goes away. Fixed addresses only.
